# Copy this file to web/.dev.vars for local Worker development.
# It is a reference/placeholder file only and must never contain production
# credentials. web/.dev.vars is gitignored; keep real values out of Git.
#
# Required for wrangler dev / pnpm dev:local (see AGENTS.md). The Worker
# fails auth/programs/attendance routes closed (503) without it. Generate a
# fresh local-only value; it is never the real deploy secret
# (`wrangler secret put EFCC_ACCESS_TOKEN_SECRET`) and rotating it only
# invalidates local sessions/access tokens.
#   openssl rand -hex 32
EFCC_ACCESS_TOKEN_SECRET="REPLACE_WITH_A_LOCAL_ONLY_RANDOM_HEX_STRING"